ils.\n\nMove the addclass and listbystudent sections and summary rows to their\nintermediate positions for the team\u0027s planned ordering. Add before and\nafter screenshots from the reference branch to illustrate both commands.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":133,"deletions":120}}},{"hash":"aaec69aac73d7403e8edb46280961e99d66fc1d6","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #289 from Ryanyzh/refine-owned-guide-sections","messageBody":"Refine addclass and listbystudent documentation","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-11-02T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"e987261e577d8a772b166f183aca0dfc6a626d20","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update UI diagrams to match the implementation","messageBody":"The UI diagram omits class management and command handling helpers.\nShowing the custom JavaFX controls in the same figure also makes the\nstructure difficult to read at guide-page size.\n\nUpdate the main figure to show windows, panels, cards and command\nhandling. Show custom JavaFX controls and their base classes in a\nseparate figure, and align the Developer Guide explanation with both.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":87,"deletions":17}}},{"hash":"c88aad114ccd9288e396319522329f0b8ac59e74","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #301 from LeeWenKang-NUS/branch-Update-DGUG","messageBody":"Update UG and DG","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"cc221b06d2304e60c8e54ea2f1d1c4ceed2ccb31","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix guide examples and overflow documentation","messageBody":"Some guide examples reuse sample student numbers or assume a fresh\nfolder contains no students. The guides also describe overflowing\npaired indices as parse failures, while two overflow tests accidentally\nconvert an already-overflowed negative int to a string.\n\nUse unused example numbers and clear disposable walkthrough data before\nrelying on displayed indices. Document sample startup data and rejection\nof overflowing paired indices during execution. Correct the existing\noverflow tests to use long arithmetic and exercise positive values above\nInteger.MAX_VALUE.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":49,"deletions":19},"test-code":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"4d17ccd5dbe6383f63d828c67504cda73a052177","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #306 from LeeWenKang-NUS/branch-Update-DGUG","messageBody":"Remove command example from user guide","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"de1c263de2ad46e6b17c741e1030e934e77cec27","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Simplify the UI class diagram to follow AB3","messageBody":"The UI overview includes command helpers and a separate controls figure,\nwhich add detail beyond the component structure shown in AB3.\n\nFocus the main diagram on windows, panels, cards and their dependencies,\nwhile retaining the academic-class UI parts specific to TAssist. Remove\nthe controls figure and keep its short explanation in the Developer\nGuide.\nLink command-history navigation to its existing dedicated section.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":21,"deletions":68}}},{"hash":"203975e78eb406e04c38602d7a27d21959fbc874","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Align UI card associations with AB3","messageBody":"The UI overview uses creation dependencies where AB3 shows the\npanel-to-card structure with associations and multiplicities.\n\nReplace both creation dependencies with solid associations showing\nzero or more cards per panel to follow the AB3 overview style.\nRemove the requested explanatory paragraphs from the Developer Guide\nto keep the UI section concise.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":2,"deletions":9}}}]},{"date":"2026-11-03T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"e4efe5272583106ec8ec8b4259763b8af0f75ff3","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Remove sample student counts from the guides","messageBody":"Explicit startup counts distract from the guide examples and test setup.\nRemove the six-student and no-class startup statements from both guides\nand the command-hints testing notes.\n\nKeep the initial clear commands and disposable-folder instructions so\nwalkthrough indices remain predictable without relying on sample counts.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":12,"deletions":15}}},{"hash":"23f6eed57f730a50a6a8a9e150bd301f2fa01d5b","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into fix-guide-examples-and-overflow","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"ec7080395cbaa1eb7300872b6742aa90f13cb924","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #298 from Ryanyzh/update-ui-class-diagram","messageBody":"Update UI diagrams to match the implementation","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"abe3aaac0e35a3339af59fb5862e3d6dc275670c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Clarify the delete example output","messageBody":"The delete section names Alice in its example output, although the\nselected student depends on the displayed list and current saved data.\nLabel that output as conditional on Alice being the deleted student to\navoid implying that list followed by delete 2 always selects her.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"556d7be50cf7c9aa2842c7e7819985dd1be4eff1","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #318 from LeeWenKang-NUS/branch-Update-UG-Image","messageBody":"Update assign user guide image","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"Luigi-Simon":[{"date":"2026-11-02T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"95d0db36d2833ca1395e0222cc5a9004d48da02c","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #292 from Aster0/reorder-ug","messageBody":"Reordering `EditClass` \u0026 `Unassign Student` in UG","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"c6b254e2c89d104b73a3a99a5df0f32b706f12e7","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update listbyclass and attendance user guide